    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12382834/comment/12544095",
          "id": "12544095",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=michaelbusch",
            "name": "michaelbusch",
            "key": "michaelbusch",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael Busch",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "We want to add the following methods to Payload:\n\n{code:java}\npublic void setPayload(byte[] data);\npublic void setPayload(byte[] data, int offset, int length);\npublic byte[] getPayload();\npublic int getPayloadOffset();\n\npublic Object clone();\n{code}\n\nAlso Payload should implement Cloneable.\n\n\nFurthermore, we want to add a fieldName arg to Similarity.scorePayload().\n\nI think we can also remove the \"experimental\" warnings from the Payload\nAPIs now?\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=michaelbusch",
            "name": "michaelbusch",
            "key": "michaelbusch",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael Busch",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2007-11-20T22:10:15.106+0000",
          "updated": "2007-11-20T22:10:15.106+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12382834/comment/12544715",
          "id": "12544715",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=michaelbusch",
            "name": "michaelbusch",
